      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "Mr. Gaurav Pawar, Advocate for the respondent nos. 2 & 3.\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nHon'ble Vivek Bharti Sharma, J.\nThis criminal misc. application is filed under Section 528 of B.N.S.S. by the petitioner/accused for quashing of the summoning order dated 29.08.2022, charge-sheet no. 01 of 2022 as well as the entire proceedings of Special Session Trial No.91 of 2022 titled as \"State vs. Abhay\"\npending in the court of learned Fast Track Court/Special Court (POCSO)/Additional District Judge, Dehradun under Section 376 of IPC and Section 5/6 of POCSO Act,\nP.S. Nehru Colony, District Dehradun qua the petitioner/accused, in view of the compromise arrived at between the parties.",
